OL,3,GNEWSAI refuse to miss daily exercises,
OL,4,Asays 103-year-old
OL,5,
OL,6,FA retired school inspector says his
OL,7,Fdiscipline and determination to
OL,8,Fexercise each day has allowed him to
OL,9,Fremain living in his own house as he
OL,10,Fcelebrates his 103rd birthday.
OL,12,FRon Letheren settled in Ellingham, on
OL,13,Fthe Norfolk-Suffolk border near Bungay,
OL,14,Fabout 40 years ago with his late wife,
OL,15,Fafter teaching across Essex and being
OL,16,Fheadmaster of two schools.
