OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAI refuse to miss daily exercises,
OL,4,Asays 103-year-old
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe centenarian, who ended his career
OL,7,Fas a senior education inspector for the
OL,8,FInner London Education Authority at
OL,9,FCounty Hall, said he also took a "good
OL,10,Flot of pride" in completing
OL,11,F"complicated" online puzzles each day.
OL,13,FThe former military officer, who served
OL,14,Fin WW2, said about his exercise
OL,15,Froutine: "I won't miss it, no matter
OL,16,Fhow I feel."
